{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Yet Another Climbing Game",
    "steam_appid": 3329220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/078dc0123330a6813f828b04f29eb58a.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yet Another Climbing Game</strong> is a punishing ascent, a twisted tribute to the agony of determination. You guide your climber with a single, clumsy mechanic, grappling upward with imprecise precision. That\u2019s all there is. With persistence, you might find yourself soaring, stumbling, and sometimes hanging by a thread. Great mysteries and perhaps some reward await those daring (or foolish) enough to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/369a39096ae90d9a94e4e7edd4ab6f23.poster.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/369a39096ae90d9a94e4e7edd4ab6f23.webm?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/369a39096ae90d9a94e4e7edd4ab6f23.mp4?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To quote the game's inspiration:<br><i>&quot;Only a person who loves pain will reach the peak, because there is no other way.&quot;\u00a0</i>-A random from the internet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll drag yourself up with a simple but precise control system that seems purpose-built to test your patience. Each grasp, each swing, each slip has the power to make you question your choices. With enough resilience, you might just find your way up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/035830ac277342aa9943fc2afaeb97ae.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your progress, over and over again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the few who reach the top, something curious awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/667351a8855687799436848a47d945aa.poster.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/667351a8855687799436848a47d945aa.webm?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/667351a8855687799436848a47d945aa.mp4?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/078dc0123330a6813f828b04f29eb58a.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yet Another Climbing Game</strong> is a punishing ascent, a twisted tribute to the agony of determination. You guide your climber with a single, clumsy mechanic, grappling upward with imprecise precision. That\u2019s all there is. With persistence, you might find yourself soaring, stumbling, and sometimes hanging by a thread. Great mysteries and perhaps some reward await those daring (or foolish) enough to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/369a39096ae90d9a94e4e7edd4ab6f23.poster.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/369a39096ae90d9a94e4e7edd4ab6f23.webm?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/369a39096ae90d9a94e4e7edd4ab6f23.mp4?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To quote the game's inspiration:<br><i>&quot;Only a person who loves pain will reach the peak, because there is no other way.&quot;\u00a0</i>-A random from the internet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll drag yourself up with a simple but precise control system that seems purpose-built to test your patience. Each grasp, each swing, each slip has the power to make you question your choices. With enough resilience, you might just find your way up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/035830ac277342aa9943fc2afaeb97ae.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your progress, over and over again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the few who reach the top, something curious awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/667351a8855687799436848a47d945aa.poster.avif?t=1755208184\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/667351a8855687799436848a47d945aa.webm?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329220/extras/667351a8855687799436848a47d945aa.mp4?t=1755208184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
